---
interface Props {
  eyebrow?: string;
  title?: string;
}

const { eyebrow = 'About Us', title = 'Reliable IT infrastructure for business.' } = Astro.props;
---

<section aria-labelledby="about-title" class="bg-brand-100">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-8 py-section">
    <header class="font-semibold text-brand-900">
      <p class="text-2xl uppercase">{eyebrow}</p>
      <h2 id="about-title" class="mt-3.5 text-4xl/tight sm:text-display">{title}</h2>
    </header>

    <div class="mt-8 grid gap-12 lg:grid-cols-2 xl:grid-cols-[1fr_669px]">
      <div>
        <h3 class="text-2xl font-semibold uppercase text-brand-900 sm:text-heading">Company Overview</h3>
        <p class="mt-4 text-body text-pretty text-copy">
          BaseNET Technology Sdn Bhd (BaseNET) was established in 1996 (incorporated April 1994) registered under
          Ministry of Finance (MOF) with full range of IT code. The company was initially setup to supply the demands
          and needs in IT industry that which is rapidly grows in Malaysia. We are committed to supply excellent
          quality IT services and focus on end-to-end IT solutions that includes Hardware &amp; Software Solutions,
          Structured Cabling Solution, Support &amp; Maintenance Services.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h3 class="text-2xl font-semibold uppercase text-brand-900 sm:text-heading">Company Vision &amp; Mission</h3>
        <div class="mt-4 space-y-4 text-body text-copy">
          <p>
            <strong class="font-black">Vision</strong>: To be a Preferred &amp; Market Leader for system integrator and
            innovative solutions provider.
          </p>
          <p>
            <strong class="font-black">Mission</strong>: We are a market-focused, Process-centric organization that
            develops and delivers innovative solutions to our customers, and provides a dynamic environment for our
            employee
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
